WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.252
♪ (TRIUMPHANT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:09.092
RECEPTIONIST:
Do you have an appointment?

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:11.428
I don't have an appointment.

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:13.388
Do you need to see the doctor?

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:14.639
Uh-uh.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:16.307
Can I ask what you're doing?

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:20.270
I needed somewhere to wait,
and this is a waiting room.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.609
You're just using
this waiting room...

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:27.444
To wait.

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:30.780
♪ ("CURB YOUR ENTHUSIASM"
THEME PLAYS) ♪

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:34.993
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

